---
<section class="py-24 px-6 relative w-full" style="background: var(--bg-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(127,119,221,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%); pointer-events: none;"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="page-tag justify-center mb-6">
      // MISSION_READY
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-display font-black text-4xl md:text-6xl uppercase tracking-tighter text-white mb-6" style="text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(127,119,221,0.2);">
      Your First Mission Awaits, Agent.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Stop watching tutorials. Start building AI pipelines. Join 2,400+ developers mastering machine learning through gameplay.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="font-mono font-bold px-8 py-3.5 rounded transition-all hover:opacity-90 lift"
         style="background: #7F77DD; color: #EEEDFE; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 13px; box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(127,119,221,0.2);">
        START FREE
      </a>
      <a href="#curriculum" class="font-mono font-bold px-8 py-3.5 rounded transition-all lift"
         style="background: rgba(127,119,221,0.08); color: #AFA9EC; border: 1px solid rgba(127,119,221,0.25); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">
        VIEW CURRICULUM
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
